              ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text in7ERA3o7Rnw7LQ4O"><p>Think about the last time you were hit with a stressful email, a tight deadline, or a long commute. What did you do with your hands? Maybe you bit your nails. Maybe you tapped your pen against your lips. Maybe you reached for a sugary snack, a third cup of coffee, or a vape. We call these "bad habits." We call it "lack of willpower." But the truth is much more fascinating, and much more biological.</p></div></div
